1
00:01:37,530 --> 00:01:42,910
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,390 --> 00:01:45,940
[Episode 15]

3
00:01:47,370 --> 00:01:54,220
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

4
00:01:54,289 --> 00:02:01,530
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

5
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,520
What are you trying to do?

6
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:59,000
I'd never take advantage of
someone in distress.

7
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,920
Or is it because you think
this scar is unsightly

8
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,070
and don't want anyone to see it?

9
00:02:01,550 --> 00:02:04,910
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

10
00:02:04,940 --> 00:02:08,639
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

11
00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:15,510
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

12
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:22,700
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

13
00:02:22,829 --> 00:02:30,000
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

14
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,310
If it hurts,

15
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,310
you can hold on tighter.

16
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:33,810
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

17
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,280
I wouldn't mind.

18
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:37,260
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

19
00:02:37,390 --> 00:02:44,740
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

20
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:51,210
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

21
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:58,610
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

22
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:02,480
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

23
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:05,860
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

24
00:03:05,890 --> 00:03:12,900
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

25
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:20,400
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

26
00:03:20,430 --> 00:03:27,750
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

27
00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:31,880
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

28
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:35,140
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

29
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,000
Chunzhi.

30
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:34,520
Victory news came
from the west of the city,

31
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,680
saying that half of the northern bandits
have retreated.

32
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:40,820
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

33
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,150
To win this battle,

34
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,680
we still have to rely
on your father's help.

35
00:03:52,590 --> 00:03:54,310
Fourth Lady has a strong temper,

36
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:56,520
and is definitely not someone
who changes her mind easily.

37
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,630
If you understand,

38
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,650
you should let it go.

39
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,840
Letting go

40
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,150
is easy to say.

41
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:06,520
But in this world,

42
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,920
not many people can do it.

43
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,610
The bitterness of feelings

44
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:13,120
is in that

45
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:16,230
while knowing it's impossible,

46
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,640
one still insists on it.

47
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:20,950
Forget it.

48
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,750
Since I have seen Fourth Lady,

49
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:24,390
I shall

50
00:04:24,510 --> 00:04:25,910
go back to fulfill my duty

51
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:29,150
and wipe out the remnants
of these bandits.

52
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,040
Let's go!

53
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,680
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

54
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:34,480
Lanshan!

55
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:37,400
Where are you going?

56
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:38,440
To kill enemies!

57
00:04:41,830 --> 00:04:42,720
Brat.

58
00:05:08,310 --> 00:05:15,070
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

59
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:21,620
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

60
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:29,360
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

61
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:36,780
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

62
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,150
When I was little,

63
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:35,310
someone once told me:

64
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,560
no matter what happens,

65
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:43,850
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

66
00:05:40,150 --> 00:05:41,240
one has to survive.

67
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,560
Only by surviving

68
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,950
is there hope.

69
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:53,950
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

70
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:47,150
So since then,

71
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:51,010
no matter what difficulties I encounter,

72
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,159
as long as I think of these words,

73
00:05:54,290 --> 00:06:01,250
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

74
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,290
there is nothing I can't overcome.

75
00:05:59,040 --> 00:05:59,830
Today,

76
00:06:01,290 --> 00:06:08,680
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

77
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,160
I'm telling you these words too.

78
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:07,840
You have to survive too,

79
00:06:08,710 --> 00:06:12,290
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

80
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,270
okay?

81
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:15,930
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

82
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:22,070
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

83
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:11,320
Thank you, Fourth Lady,
for saving my life.

84
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:17,710
You are so good at making trouble for me.

85
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,310
If I saw you less often,

86
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,270
maybe

87
00:07:20,270 --> 00:07:22,480
I could live a few more years
of peaceful life.

88
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,240
Is that so?

89
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,040
But the how nervous you looked just now...

90
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,890
seems like
you're concerned about my safety.

91
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,150
Fourth Lady.

92
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,950
Lord Yan is awake.

93
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:42,800
Just in time.

94
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,890
Hurry up and eat something.

95
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,920
I'll go get busy first.

96
00:07:48,270 --> 00:07:49,470
Thank you, Madam Pei.

97
00:07:50,150 --> 00:07:51,880
Aren't you looking for Cui'er?

98
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,000
If Madam Pei is here,

99
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,200
how could Cui'er not be here?

100
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,620
She is now Madam Pei's personal maid,

101
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,800
and has changed her name to Guoniang.

102
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,870
Careful.

103
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,890
Madam, does your back hurt?

104
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:15,600
It's fine.

105
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,270
Everyone will get some.

106
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:17,870
Thank you.

107
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:18,870
Here.

108
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:24,360
Here.

109
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:27,200
Madam, you've been busy all night.
Let me do it.

110
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,310
Okay, then you do it.

111
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:32,030
Take a rest.

112
00:08:32,789 --> 00:08:33,360
Slowly.

113
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,260
Careful, it's hot.

114
00:08:45,550 --> 00:08:46,550
Fourth Lady,

115
00:08:46,550 --> 00:08:47,750
what brings you here?

116
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:49,910
Madam Pei,

117
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,700
I'm looking for Guoniang.

118
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:53,000
Guo?

119
00:08:54,030 --> 00:08:54,960
What is it about?

120
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,910
I'd like to ask her some questions

121
00:08:56,910 --> 00:08:58,120
about my mother.

122
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:02,440
Of course.

123
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:03,840
Come, Guo.

124
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,530
Go with the Fourth Lady.

125
00:09:06,030 --> 00:09:06,720
I'll do it.

126
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,630
Go.

127
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,200
I have followed Madam for many years

128
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,840
and am not familiar
with the Xie Residence.

129
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,910
I wonder why My Lady summoned me.

130
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:29,770
Are you really not familiar
with the Xie Residence?

131
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,220
What should I call you?

132
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,910
Guoniang...

133
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:35,790
or Cui'er?

134
00:09:41,030 --> 00:09:42,960
I can't escape this fate after all.

135
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,520
I guessed you would come,

136
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:51,080
but I didn't expect it to be so soon.

137
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,820
So many years have passed.

138
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,980
What's the point
of still pursuing this matter?

139
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,980
It just adds to your troubles.

140
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,660
This is about my mother's innocence,

141
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:04,390
not some so-called trouble.

142
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:06,530
My mother didn't kill anyone.

143
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,060
Why should she bear
the infamy of a murderer?

144
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:13,630
Guoniang,

145
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:16,330
please testify for my mother.

146
00:10:16,910 --> 00:10:17,870
If possible,

147
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:21,870
I wouldn't want Concubine Xia
and Concubine Jin to die in vain either.

148
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:23,750
But overturning a case is not easy.

149
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:25,910
They are just dead people from the past.

150
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:27,910
Do you think anyone cares about the truth

151
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:29,550
here at the Xie family?

152
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,390
Fourth Lady.

153
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:36,000
I'm just afraid that
before you find out the truth,

154
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:37,760
you'll end up like your mother.

155
00:10:40,630 --> 00:10:42,030
After all these years,

156
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:43,630
you've been hiding

157
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,890
and changed your name.

158
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:46,990
You're just afraid of death.

159
00:10:50,270 --> 00:10:51,720
I've already died once.

160
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:53,960
The old Cui'er

161
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:56,280
died long ago with Fourth Madam

162
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,200
and those who knew the truth,

163
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,480
together.

164
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:08,240
The past of the Xie family
has nothing to do with me.

165
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:10,480
Please don't come

166
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:12,810
and disturb my life anymore, Fourth Lady.

167
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:14,480
If it's true as you said

168
00:11:14,790 --> 00:11:16,920
that you no longer care about the past,

169
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,920
then why did you change your name

170
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,080
to Guo?

171
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,240
Madam.

172
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:30,750
The rice's almost finished.

173
00:11:31,030 --> 00:11:31,960
The city is still under martial law

174
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,320
and no one can go in or out.

175
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,550
Where can we get rice?

176
00:11:35,030 --> 00:11:36,200
Don't worry.

177
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:38,360
Lord Yan prepared a pass for us.

178
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,010
I'll go buy some rice later.

179
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,810
Help me chop those vegetables.

180
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:44,440
Yes.

181
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:45,390
Here.

182
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:51,270
Thanks to Zhenglun
for bringing reinforcements,

183
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:53,480
our Xie Residence is safe.

184
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,320
Son,

185
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,650
are you alright?

186
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,240
I'm fine, Mother.

187
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:01,200
But Fourth Sister...

188
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:03,000
The city was in chaos last night.

189
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,480
A young lady out alone like her—

190
00:12:05,910 --> 00:12:08,040
it's hard to tell if she's still alive.

191
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,190
We haven't found her yet,

192
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:13,060
but it doesn't mean
she met with an accident.

193
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,030
Maybe

194
00:12:14,870 --> 00:12:16,200
she is with Lord Yan.

195
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:17,440
Or maybe

196
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:20,670
she went to the disaster relief site
outside the city.

197
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,670
Zhenglun is right.

198
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,240
The city was in chaos last night.

199
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:33,960
It's already a blessing
that our Xie Residence

200
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:35,080
is safe.

201
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:36,270
Mother,

202
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:37,670
don't worry too much.

203
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,150
Qingyuan is a mascot.

204
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,000
She is blessed

205
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:43,480
and will return safely.

206
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,030
What mascot?

207
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:47,480
She clearly came to cause trouble.

208
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,510
Enough!

209
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,750
Qingyuan

210
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:56,000
is a lady of our Xie family after all.

211
00:12:57,480 --> 00:13:00,340
How can you talk about
her life and death so lightly?

212
00:13:02,750 --> 00:13:03,840
Send people to search

213
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,500
for Fourth Lady immediately.

214
00:13:05,750 --> 00:13:06,960
Don't forget

215
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:09,670
why she went out.

216
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:11,720
-Yes.
-Yes.

217
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:14,150
Zhenglun,

218
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:18,150
is there any news about Wei Changyan?

219
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:20,480
He has escaped.

220
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:23,190
The authorities are hunting him down.

221
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,080
Guoniang.

222
00:13:27,750 --> 00:13:29,480
I know you are different from those

223
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,680
who harmed my mother.

224
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,560
If you tell the truth,

225
00:13:33,510 --> 00:13:34,360
it might be

226
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:36,030
a relief for you.

227
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,970
I've done many wrong things in my life.

228
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,200
I wanted a home

229
00:13:44,870 --> 00:13:46,200
and gave myself to a man,

230
00:13:46,270 --> 00:13:48,750
only to be sold
and reduced to a medicine slave.

231
00:13:48,750 --> 00:13:50,480
I wanted to turn my life around,

232
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,530
so I hid in the noble Xie Residence.

233
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:56,310
Yet I was reduced to an accomplice
in the concubines' fights.

234
00:13:56,630 --> 00:13:57,790
For half my life,

235
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,030
I have been hiding and wandering,

236
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:01,440
living like a ghost.

237
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,030
Only Madam Pei

238
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,000
truly...

239
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:09,750
truly accepted me.

240
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,300
Little beggar.

241
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:12,390
Come here.

242
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,720
Help me distribute
the rest of the porridge.

243
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:17,480
I'm going to go get the travel pass
to buy some grain.

244
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,120
Yes.

245
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:20,240
She was very good to me.

246
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,320
-In this world...
-Don't worry, everyone. There's enough.

247
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,780
There is no longer a place
for people like us.

248
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,440
My only salvation

249
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,510
was Madam Pei.

250
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:40,480
Who are you?

251
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,120
[Travel Pass]

252
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:45,180
What are you doing?

253
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:46,440
[Travel Pass]

254
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,550
But given Madam Pei's nature,

255
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:04,270
she would certainly want

256
00:15:04,510 --> 00:15:06,110
you to testify for my mother.

257
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:09,030
Fourth Lady.

258
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,750
I changed my name to Guo

259
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,550
not just to remind myself

260
00:15:13,550 --> 00:15:15,410
of the mistakes I made in the past,

261
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,870
but also to warn myself

262
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:19,270
that the past is the past,

263
00:15:19,790 --> 00:15:21,250
and I shouldn't look back.

264
00:15:24,030 --> 00:15:25,000
Murder!

265
00:15:26,030 --> 00:15:27,000
Somebody help!

266
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,220
Something happened to Madam Pei!

267
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,030
Help!

268
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:47,550
Madam!

269
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:48,630
Madam!

270
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:50,790
-What's wrong, madam?
-Excuse me.

271
00:15:50,790 --> 00:15:51,720
Guo...

272
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,320
Madam!

273
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:54,720
Madam!

274
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:55,840
Guo...

275
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,080
Guo...

276
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,120
Who?

277
00:15:59,510 --> 00:16:00,320
Who was it?

278
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:03,240
In the future, you must live well

279
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,670
by yourself.

280
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:06,840
Madam.

281
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:07,870
Madam.

282
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:12,440
You are no one's servant.

283
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,630
You are yourself.

284
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:18,200
Madam.

285
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:20,040
Please stop talking, Madam.

286
00:16:22,270 --> 00:16:23,270
Help...

287
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:24,960
Help!

288
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:27,750
Help!

289
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:29,840
Help me...

290
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,480
Help me...

291
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:34,200
take good care of them...

292
00:16:37,630 --> 00:16:38,240
Madam.

293
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,440
Madam.

294
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,030
Madam.

295
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,750
Madam!

296
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:52,240
Someone please save her!

297
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:54,600
Someone please save Madam!

298
00:16:54,910 --> 00:16:55,720
Guoniang!

299
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,630
I saw a man

300
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,770
running towards the thick forest.

301
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,200
Guoniang!

302
00:17:06,349 --> 00:17:07,349
Come out!

303
00:17:10,109 --> 00:17:11,400
Come out here!

304
00:17:15,349 --> 00:17:16,550
Come out!

305
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,069
Come out!

306
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:23,220
Come out!

307
00:17:24,750 --> 00:17:25,550
Who is it?

308
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:27,319
Come out here!

309
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,030
Come out here!

310
00:17:29,790 --> 00:17:30,720
Guo!

311
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:33,510
Guo!

312
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,480
Let her go.

313
00:17:49,350 --> 00:17:51,240
The whole city is hunting
for Northern bandits.

314
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,700
Do you think
that travel pass will be useful?

315
00:17:59,350 --> 00:18:00,070
Qingyuan.

316
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:02,480
Qingyuan!

317
00:18:04,510 --> 00:18:05,200
Qingyuan!

318
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:07,660
Don't move.

319
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:09,010
Take me instead of her.

320
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:10,550
Qingyuan!

321
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:13,920
You should know very well
who's more important

322
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,300
to Yan Rui—me or her?

323
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:16,590
Don't,

324
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:17,350
Fourth Lady.

325
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,820
Since you have nowhere to run,

326
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:28,310
why not trade me for a way out?

327
00:18:30,590 --> 00:18:31,550
She is right.

328
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,310
Yan Rui—

329
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,780
Don't come closer.

330
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:39,830
Wei Changyan.

331
00:18:40,350 --> 00:18:41,350
If you hurt her,

332
00:18:41,790 --> 00:18:42,790
not only me,

333
00:18:43,270 --> 00:18:45,670
but the Xie family
won't let you off either.

334
00:18:45,750 --> 00:18:47,030
The Xie family?

335
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,920
Trading her life for my silence,

336
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:53,000
I'm afraid Xie Shu
would wish for nothing more.

337
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,240
After all,

338
00:18:57,790 --> 00:19:00,510
he and I serve the same Lord.

339
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,880
Do you think I don't know?

340
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:10,160
You've been plotting against me all along,

341
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,640
just to find out

342
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:13,400
who is behind me.

343
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,240
Right?

344
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:17,550
Fine.

345
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,960
I shall tell you then.

346
00:20:11,270 --> 00:20:13,130
Fourth Sister fell into the water

347
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,700
and hasn't been found yet.

348
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:17,610
I'm afraid it's more likely bad news.

349
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:21,810
Although the bandits are suppressed,

350
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,240
Qingyuan is gone.

351
00:20:25,310 --> 00:20:27,680
I feel terrible.

352
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:32,160
If I hadn't argued with her...

353
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:37,070
But with her dead,

354
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:39,540
whether she belongs to the Xie family

355
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:41,830
is no longer important.

356
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:44,680
Mother.

357
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,790
We still haven't found her yet.

358
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:47,270
Perhaps

359
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:49,840
there is still a glimmer of hope.

360
00:20:51,030 --> 00:20:51,830
Hope?

361
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,110
Uh...

362
00:20:53,270 --> 00:20:54,860
the water flows so fast.

363
00:20:55,110 --> 00:20:56,640
How could there be any hope?

364
00:20:57,590 --> 00:20:59,000
Qingyuan

365
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:01,900
wandered about destitute in her childhood.

366
00:21:02,750 --> 00:21:04,410
She returned to the residence

367
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,590
and just had a few

368
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:08,920
peaceful days,

369
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:12,610
but then she encountered this disaster.

370
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:14,750
Her funeral affairs

371
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:18,880
should be handled properly.

372
00:21:42,030 --> 00:21:43,430
Prepare for the funeral.

373
00:21:43,830 --> 00:21:45,490
It will be held in half a month.

374
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:46,640
Yes.

375
00:21:51,030 --> 00:21:52,830
Thanks to that Qingyuan's death

376
00:21:52,830 --> 00:21:53,890
making Master sad,

377
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,600
I now have another chance

378
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:57,350
to win his favor back.

379
00:21:58,790 --> 00:21:59,750
I can tell...

380
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:05,260
you are not really sad
about Fourth Sister's death.

381
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:06,750
Brother.

382
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,200
You child.

383
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,400
How foolish.

384
00:22:09,790 --> 00:22:12,310
She targeted us time and again.

385
00:22:13,830 --> 00:22:15,720
Why should I be sad for her?

386
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:21,000
Mother.

387
00:22:22,750 --> 00:22:23,680
Stop it.

388
00:22:25,550 --> 00:22:26,240
Can you?

389
00:22:28,510 --> 00:22:29,350
I beg you.

390
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:33,000
I beg you, stop it.

391
00:22:37,790 --> 00:22:38,750
What did you say?

392
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:41,590
What did you just say?

393
00:22:46,310 --> 00:22:47,350
All these years,

394
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:49,350
all these pain...

395
00:22:50,510 --> 00:22:52,270
Do you think it's for myself?

396
00:22:53,310 --> 00:22:55,160
It's all for you two.

397
00:22:56,070 --> 00:22:58,270
I can accept that Zhengjun is ignorant.

398
00:22:59,070 --> 00:23:00,730
But you're the older brother.

399
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:04,920
The treatment you received
in the Northern Frontier—

400
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:06,200
if it weren't for me,

401
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:08,510
would you have gotten it?

402
00:23:15,550 --> 00:23:16,310
Mother.

403
00:23:17,110 --> 00:23:18,970
I just want to say one thing to you.

404
00:23:21,350 --> 00:23:24,080
Father has been good enough
to us all these years.

405
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:26,550
There's no need to fight for more.

406
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:38,510
You child,

407
00:23:40,750 --> 00:23:43,270
studying must have ruined your brain.

408
00:23:44,070 --> 00:23:45,590
Treading on shoulders to reach the peak;

409
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:47,440
cradling human faces
only to grind them into dust.

410
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:49,790
You know to worry about
other people's mothers

411
00:23:49,790 --> 00:23:51,070
becoming victims,

412
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,960
but when have you ever worried

413
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:57,760
about the sacrifices
your own mother made for you?

414
00:24:10,830 --> 00:24:11,290
Mother.

415
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:11,900
Mother!

416
00:24:12,590 --> 00:24:15,240
But none of this is an excuse
for you to hurt others.

417
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:16,570
Stop talking, Brother.

418
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,310
The reason you can stand here today

419
00:24:25,310 --> 00:24:27,030
to criticize me

420
00:24:28,510 --> 00:24:30,440
is because the price of the path

421
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:33,750
you took

422
00:24:35,790 --> 00:24:37,350
was paid by your mother.

423
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:42,160
You are all so high and mighty,

424
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,620
keeping your hands clean—

425
00:24:44,550 --> 00:24:45,440
that's fine.

426
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:50,270
But when your mother stood in front of you

427
00:24:50,270 --> 00:24:52,530
and shielded you from all the bad things,

428
00:24:53,200 --> 00:24:54,590
where were you?

429
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:57,690
Without me,
who would protect you two brothers?

430
00:25:07,750 --> 00:25:08,280
Brother!

431
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:09,070
Brother!

432
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:11,400
Mother.

433
00:25:13,310 --> 00:25:13,960
Brother!

434
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:33,590
We actually

435
00:25:33,590 --> 00:25:35,880
miraculously survived that day.

436
00:25:37,750 --> 00:25:39,550
God must have his intentions for

437
00:25:40,270 --> 00:25:41,870
making such an arrangement.

438
00:25:43,350 --> 00:25:45,160
Maybe it's so that you and I

439
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:51,730
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

440
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,640
can be like this,

441
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:50,400
spending a few leisurely days
in this small fishing village.

442
00:25:51,750 --> 00:25:58,230
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

443
00:25:58,330 --> 00:26:05,970
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

444
00:26:06,090 --> 00:26:13,390
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

445
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:13,920
The doctor said

446
00:26:13,530 --> 00:26:20,690
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

447
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:16,690
your injury needs
another half month of rest.

448
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:18,310
Just rest here.

449
00:26:19,510 --> 00:26:21,310
The bandit rebellion has been suppressed.

450
00:26:20,820 --> 00:26:30,560
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

451
00:26:21,310 --> 00:26:23,270
Hengtang is at peace now.

452
00:26:25,310 --> 00:26:27,270
It wouldn't be bad

453
00:26:27,510 --> 00:26:30,040
if we stayed here
for the rest of our lives too.

454
00:26:30,900 --> 00:26:38,100
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

455
00:26:32,640 --> 00:26:34,480
We both have many things to do.

456
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:36,530
We can't stay here forever.

457
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:45,430
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

458
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:43,650
Then let's make it half a month.

459
00:26:43,750 --> 00:26:44,880
For this half month,

460
00:26:45,200 --> 00:26:46,200
I am not Yan Rui,

461
00:26:45,450 --> 00:26:49,010
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

462
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:48,040
and you are not Qingyuan.

463
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:48,960
I am

464
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:51,680
a fisherman, Yan,
from this tiny Anxiang Village.

465
00:26:49,030 --> 00:26:52,540
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

466
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:55,310
And you are the pretty and articulate

467
00:26:52,570 --> 00:26:58,960
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

468
00:26:55,790 --> 00:26:57,920
village woman, Yunya, how about that?

469
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:04,720
If

470
00:27:05,480 --> 00:27:07,340
I didn't have to avenge my mother,

471
00:27:08,110 --> 00:27:10,310
and you didn't have to plan for rations.

472
00:27:10,750 --> 00:27:11,590
I wonder

473
00:27:11,830 --> 00:27:13,830
what we would do staying here.

474
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:21,090
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

475
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:17,720
Yan would bask in the sun every day,

476
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:19,030
and drink some wine.

477
00:27:19,030 --> 00:27:20,160
Having fish today

478
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:21,160
but none tomorrow

479
00:27:21,210 --> 00:27:28,320
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

480
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,240
is fine.

481
00:27:23,790 --> 00:27:24,790
What about Yunya?

482
00:27:25,110 --> 00:27:25,880
Yunya...

483
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:29,200
In these days of eternal spring,

484
00:27:28,450 --> 00:27:35,850
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

485
00:27:29,590 --> 00:27:31,850
she can finally put down the heavy burden

486
00:27:32,590 --> 00:27:35,000
and live a life as she pleases.

487
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:43,040
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

488
00:27:39,590 --> 00:27:40,240
Move?

489
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,940
Where are we moving to?

490
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:43,790
To a place

491
00:27:43,090 --> 00:27:50,190
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

492
00:27:44,590 --> 00:27:46,030
where it's always spring

493
00:27:47,270 --> 00:27:49,200
and flowers are blooming all year.

494
00:27:50,290 --> 00:28:00,860
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

495
00:27:51,350 --> 00:27:52,550
Shen Run.

496
00:27:53,070 --> 00:27:54,480
I met someone,

497
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:56,340
who looks so much like you.

498
00:27:56,880 --> 00:27:59,440
His eyes are as bright as the stars.

499
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:01,790
Sometimes, he's as gentle as you;

500
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:07,940
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

501
00:28:02,310 --> 00:28:04,550
sometimes, he's as persistent as you.

502
00:28:06,510 --> 00:28:07,480
I'm tired.

503
00:28:08,030 --> 00:28:09,640
Let me lean on Yan's shoulder.

504
00:28:08,040 --> 00:28:15,700
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

505
00:28:12,110 --> 00:28:13,310
He seems to also have

506
00:28:13,310 --> 00:28:15,070
things he must accomplish.

507
00:28:15,740 --> 00:28:18,360
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

508
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:17,550
So we always touch each other

509
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:20,200
from near and far.

510
00:28:18,380 --> 00:28:22,000
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

511
00:28:20,720 --> 00:28:22,270
Neither of us dares to reach out

512
00:28:22,030 --> 00:28:28,370
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

513
00:28:22,880 --> 00:28:25,350
to uncover each other's true secrets.

514
00:28:32,060 --> 00:28:35,050
[Half a month later]

515
00:28:43,510 --> 00:28:45,710
What is she doing here putting on a show?

516
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:01,310
Acting like a loving sister here?

517
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,480
How fake,

518
00:29:02,480 --> 00:29:03,200
seriously.

519
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:10,530
Qingyuan's whereabouts are unknown,

520
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:13,720
yet you're in such a hurry
to hold a funeral for her.

521
00:29:13,830 --> 00:29:15,110
When one dies,

522
00:29:15,110 --> 00:29:17,030
it's only natural that a funeral is held.

523
00:29:17,030 --> 00:29:19,090
What nonsense are you talking about?

524
00:29:20,510 --> 00:29:21,970
I'm not talking nonsense.

525
00:29:22,400 --> 00:29:23,890
Need I remind you

526
00:29:23,910 --> 00:29:25,640
how you used to bully her?

527
00:29:28,830 --> 00:29:31,070
Qingyuan's memorial tablet is right here.

528
00:29:31,070 --> 00:29:32,070
Yet now,

529
00:29:32,550 --> 00:29:35,080
you dress in mourning clothes
on the surface,

530
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:37,960
but you're still wearing perfume.

531
00:29:38,510 --> 00:29:41,110
You won't even give her
a last shred of respect.

532
00:29:41,550 --> 00:29:43,920
The gods are always watching.

533
00:29:45,110 --> 00:29:46,550
Maybe tonight,

534
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:49,730
Qingyuan will come to settle the score
with you!

535
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:51,020
What am I afraid of?

536
00:29:51,440 --> 00:29:53,590
Our grievances
haven't even been settled yet.

537
00:29:53,590 --> 00:29:54,270
Enough!

538
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:05,480
Miss Dong.

539
00:30:06,350 --> 00:30:07,920
Since you're here to pay your respects,

540
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:09,310
do it properly.

541
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:11,640
In front of

542
00:30:12,350 --> 00:30:13,510
Qingyuan's spirit,

543
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,980
please show some respect, everyone.

544
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,500
You too, Second Madam.

545
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:22,460
We'll discuss the shop

546
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:23,590
in the future.

547
00:30:24,030 --> 00:30:24,690
Head Madam,

548
00:30:24,710 --> 00:30:26,790
the medicine shop really can't be delayed.

549
00:30:26,790 --> 00:30:27,720
The dead is gone,

550
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:29,270
but life must go on.

551
00:30:29,510 --> 00:30:31,440
Every day we delay, we lose money.

552
00:30:31,590 --> 00:30:32,960
Why not hand it over to me?

553
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,680
Can't I manage it for Qingyuan?

554
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:35,510
Qingyuan put in

555
00:30:35,510 --> 00:30:37,350
so much effort for this shop.

556
00:30:38,270 --> 00:30:40,030
She's barely gone,

557
00:30:41,070 --> 00:30:43,440
and you're already fighting over money.

558
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:49,000
Where is the Xie family's dignity?

559
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,200
Miss Dong.

560
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:54,750
Look at the funeral expenses.

561
00:30:54,750 --> 00:30:55,790
All these lanterns

562
00:30:55,790 --> 00:30:56,590
and cloth

563
00:30:56,590 --> 00:30:57,640
cost money.

564
00:30:58,070 --> 00:31:01,160
Money is the most urgent matter right now.

565
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:02,750
Besides,

566
00:31:02,750 --> 00:31:04,830
this is our family matter—

567
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:06,440
it's not your place to speak.

568
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:09,830
-I feel sorry for Qingyuan.
-Go die in her stead, then.

569
00:31:09,830 --> 00:31:10,640
Enough.

570
00:31:11,510 --> 00:31:13,350
F-Fourth Lady?

571
00:31:28,440 --> 00:31:30,480
Who does Second Madam want dead?

572
00:31:34,310 --> 00:31:35,310
My child,

573
00:31:36,070 --> 00:31:37,070
you're alive.

574
00:31:37,750 --> 00:31:39,350
Is she a human or a ghost?

575
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:42,920
Yes, Mother,

576
00:31:43,190 --> 00:31:44,150
I'm still alive.

577
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:46,070
In broad daylight,

578
00:31:46,270 --> 00:31:48,590
could it be that I have become a ghost

579
00:31:48,830 --> 00:31:50,490
to settle scores with you all?

580
00:31:51,110 --> 00:31:52,200
You've done so much evil,

581
00:31:52,200 --> 00:31:54,260
and you dare to settle scores with us?

582
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:58,790
This funeral

583
00:31:59,110 --> 00:32:00,680
is arranged so nicely.

584
00:32:01,790 --> 00:32:03,880
It's a pity it won't be used.

585
00:32:07,480 --> 00:32:10,160
It's rare for you all
to care so much about me.

586
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:12,970
Thanks for the trouble.

587
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:15,630
Thank heavens you're alive.

588
00:32:15,750 --> 00:32:16,830
As long as you're alive.

589
00:32:16,830 --> 00:32:18,000
I told you...

590
00:32:18,400 --> 00:32:19,110
-It's fine.
-Our Fourth Sister

591
00:32:19,110 --> 00:32:21,170
-is truly a lucky one.
-This is great!

592
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:24,030
Falling off a cliff into the sea,

593
00:32:24,030 --> 00:32:25,960
you still can come back safely?

594
00:32:27,030 --> 00:32:28,750
That doesn't sound nice, Second Madam.

595
00:32:28,750 --> 00:32:30,350
I survived by a stroke of luck.

596
00:32:30,350 --> 00:32:31,070
Why

597
00:32:31,350 --> 00:32:33,440
does that make you unhappy?

598
00:32:34,770 --> 00:32:36,400
What are you talking about?

599
00:32:36,400 --> 00:32:37,640
We are family.

600
00:32:37,790 --> 00:32:39,200
Your safe return

601
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:42,030
makes me the happiest.

602
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,680
Really?

603
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:45,310
But now that I'm back alive,

604
00:32:45,310 --> 00:32:46,880
your days

605
00:32:46,880 --> 00:32:48,480
won't be easy anymore.

606
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:50,000
Is that so?

607
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:54,510
Qingyuan.

608
00:32:55,310 --> 00:32:56,350
It's been so long.

609
00:32:56,790 --> 00:32:58,880
Why didn't you send a letter home?

610
00:32:59,350 --> 00:33:01,830
Do you know how worried we were about you?

611
00:33:02,590 --> 00:33:03,640
Grandmother,

612
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:05,350
when I was away,

613
00:33:05,350 --> 00:33:06,480
I met an old friend,

614
00:33:06,750 --> 00:33:08,590
which delayed my return home.

615
00:33:08,830 --> 00:33:10,830
Apologies for making Grandmother, Father,

616
00:33:10,830 --> 00:33:12,630
and the rest of the family worry.

617
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:14,830
It's okay, Qingyuan.

618
00:33:15,110 --> 00:33:17,070
As long as you are safe.

619
00:33:17,350 --> 00:33:18,950
Everything else is trivial.

620
00:33:19,310 --> 00:33:20,110
Don't mind it.

621
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:22,640
Father.

622
00:33:23,030 --> 00:33:23,960
You promised me,

623
00:33:24,310 --> 00:33:25,510
if I went out to seek help,

624
00:33:25,510 --> 00:33:27,480
you would thoroughly investigate
Fifth Madam's death.

625
00:33:27,480 --> 00:33:29,240
I have brought the old friend back.

626
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,240
I wonder if Father

627
00:33:30,550 --> 00:33:31,880
will keep your promise.

628
00:33:37,550 --> 00:33:38,590
Qingyuan,

629
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:41,440
who is this old friend of yours

630
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:42,400
you mention?

631
00:33:43,830 --> 00:33:45,030
Let me tell you that.

632
00:33:53,030 --> 00:33:54,290
Grandmother, Father,

633
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:56,410
do you still recognize her?

634
00:34:05,070 --> 00:34:05,510
You...

635
00:34:06,310 --> 00:34:08,030
You are Fourth Madam's personal maid,

636
00:34:08,030 --> 00:34:08,960
Cui'er?

637
00:34:09,590 --> 00:34:11,880
She does look like her.

638
00:34:24,070 --> 00:34:25,330
Are you really Cui'er?

639
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:30,550
Lord Yan,

640
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:32,190
I apologize for the scene.

641
00:34:32,190 --> 00:34:33,389
It's a family matter.

642
00:34:33,630 --> 00:34:35,480
Let's move to the side hall.

643
00:34:35,510 --> 00:34:37,630
I'll have someone serve you tea,
how about that?

644
00:34:37,630 --> 00:34:38,400
No need.

645
00:34:39,110 --> 00:34:41,760
This concerns the reputation
of Fourth Lady's biological mother,

646
00:34:41,760 --> 00:34:43,280
I must intervene.

647
00:34:44,190 --> 00:34:46,550
Otherwise,
how can I face the one I fancy again?

648
00:34:46,550 --> 00:34:47,400
Don't you think,

649
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:48,280
Lord Xie?

650
00:34:52,710 --> 00:34:54,110
I remember now.

651
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:56,710
It was you back then

652
00:34:57,110 --> 00:34:58,440
who insisted

653
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:00,400
that Fourth Lady

654
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:02,760
poisoned Fifth Madam with euphorbia.

655
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:04,670
And based on your testimony,

656
00:35:04,960 --> 00:35:06,760
I followed the Xie family rules

657
00:35:07,190 --> 00:35:08,400
and punished

658
00:35:09,150 --> 00:35:10,510
Jin Chunqing.

659
00:35:16,030 --> 00:35:17,490
Fourth Madam is innocent.

660
00:35:19,150 --> 00:35:20,960
It was my momentary lapse
of judgment back then,

661
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:22,480
that made me help the wicked,

662
00:35:22,480 --> 00:35:25,480
making Fourth Madam
suffer an injustice for 19 years.

663
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,800
You say Jin Chunqing
didn't kill my mother,

664
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:29,440
then who killed my mother?

665
00:35:31,150 --> 00:35:32,280
It was Second Madam.

666
00:35:37,550 --> 00:35:38,440
Qingyuan,

667
00:35:38,440 --> 00:35:40,670
you can't just make baseless accusations.

668
00:35:40,670 --> 00:35:42,360
Saying I killed and framed someone—

669
00:35:42,360 --> 00:35:43,560
do you have evidence?

670
00:35:43,800 --> 00:35:45,060
Cui'er is the witness.

671
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:48,190
You ordered Cui'er back then

672
00:35:48,510 --> 00:35:49,480
to put euphorbia

673
00:35:49,550 --> 00:35:51,680
into Fifth Madam's pregnancy potion.

674
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:52,960
Cui'er!

675
00:35:55,280 --> 00:35:55,920
Tell me,

676
00:35:56,710 --> 00:35:58,320
how did Concubine Xia die?

677
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:02,880
Speak!

678
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:21,590
Speak!

679
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:24,960
It was...

680
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:30,020
It was Fourth Madam
who gave me a bowl of pregnancy tonic

681
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:35,290
Fifth Madam passed away years ago.

682
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:38,360
She should have reincarnated by now.

683
00:36:38,710 --> 00:36:39,030
You!

684
00:36:39,030 --> 00:36:40,510
With no proof,

685
00:36:40,710 --> 00:36:42,570
you can make up whatever you want.

686
00:36:43,110 --> 00:36:45,400
Besides, back then, didn't she personally

687
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:47,130
testify against Fourth Madam,

688
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:50,480
and then secretly disappear
for so many years?

689
00:36:50,670 --> 00:36:53,190
Now she pops up again talking nonsense.

690
00:36:53,760 --> 00:36:56,070
Is she treating this case as a joke?

691
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:59,280
Back then, my brother owed gambling debts.

692
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:01,510
Second Madam threatened us
with paying off the debts

693
00:37:01,510 --> 00:37:03,570
and forced me to betray Fourth Madam.

694
00:37:03,590 --> 00:37:05,920
I went against my conscience

695
00:37:06,110 --> 00:37:07,440
and made a huge mistake.

696
00:37:08,230 --> 00:37:08,920
After that,

697
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:12,190
Second Madam forced my brother and me
to leave Hengtang.

698
00:37:12,190 --> 00:37:14,790
That's why we wandered
to another town to hide.

699
00:37:14,840 --> 00:37:15,400
Today,

700
00:37:15,630 --> 00:37:16,890
I have come to confess.

701
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:20,800
I beg the patriarch of the Xie family

702
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:21,590
and Old Madam

703
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:23,480
to distinguish right from wrong,

704
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:25,630
clear Fourth Madam's name,

705
00:37:26,230 --> 00:37:28,560
and bring the real murderer of Fifth Madam

706
00:37:29,110 --> 00:37:30,590
to justice!

707
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:33,710
Absurd!

708
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:36,030
A lowly maidservant like you

709
00:37:36,190 --> 00:37:39,190
think you can convict me
with a few nonsensical words?

710
00:37:39,190 --> 00:37:41,150
Might as well do what Lord Yan

711
00:37:41,150 --> 00:37:42,760
and Xie Qingyuan want.

712
00:37:43,280 --> 00:37:44,550
Go to court

713
00:37:44,920 --> 00:37:47,400
and let the whole Hengtang judge

714
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,530
the right and wrong.

715
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:49,590
Sure.

716
00:37:50,400 --> 00:37:51,730
I'll help you with that.

717
00:37:52,110 --> 00:37:52,840
Fan Zhong,

718
00:37:53,480 --> 00:37:55,340
take them back to the government.

719
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:57,160
I will interrogate them myself.

720
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:57,800
You—

721
00:37:58,400 --> 00:37:58,800
Yes.

722
00:37:59,070 --> 00:37:59,760
Wait.

723
00:38:01,280 --> 00:38:01,960
Lord Yan.

724
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:02,960
I think...

725
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:06,510
this is still my private matter.

726
00:38:06,760 --> 00:38:08,490
I think you should leave it to me

727
00:38:08,710 --> 00:38:10,230
for my own consideration.

728
00:38:11,190 --> 00:38:12,030
Why?

729
00:38:12,760 --> 00:38:14,890
Lord Xie, are you showing favoritism?

730
00:38:17,030 --> 00:38:17,840
Lord Yan.

731
00:38:18,030 --> 00:38:20,440
What are you talking about?

732
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:22,580
This is my private residence.

733
00:38:23,510 --> 00:38:25,370
I have an elderly mother above me,

734
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:28,030
and wives, concubines,
and children below me.

735
00:38:28,030 --> 00:38:30,400
These are all my closest relatives.

736
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:34,800
Even if I'm being selfish and protective,

737
00:38:35,590 --> 00:38:37,110
shouldn't I be?

738
00:38:42,760 --> 00:38:44,000
However,

739
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:48,150
Cui'er's appearance is suspicious.

740
00:38:48,590 --> 00:38:52,000
I am also very surprised by what she said.

741
00:38:52,230 --> 00:38:55,800
So I must personally
investigate it clearly.

742
00:38:57,320 --> 00:38:59,190
For what happened in the past,

743
00:38:59,360 --> 00:39:01,030
there would be no one else

744
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:04,230
but me who's the most upset.

745
00:39:04,590 --> 00:39:06,800
If there really is a murderer,

746
00:39:07,110 --> 00:39:10,150
no one is more eager to find her than me.

747
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,960
I am more eager.

748
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:15,320
I wish I could rewrite the past.
